{"id":"wb-3-235","name":"中山靖王墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"中山靖王墓","text":"中山靖王墓又称为满城汉墓，位于中国河北省保定市满城区陵山，共有两座，分别属于西汉中山靖王刘胜及其妻窦绾。1968年满城汉墓因国防施工被意外发现，1982年7月23日公布为省级文物保护单位，1988年1月13日被列入第三批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E9%9D%96%E7%8E%8B%E5%A2%93","revisionId":94396948,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94396948","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0c031e3ef8bf5a6b71ae61e1.jpg","title":"ChangXingongdeng.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ChangXingongdeng.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/ChangXingongdeng.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"User Refrain on zh.wikipedia","license":"CC BY 1.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/1.0","caption":"​汉代的長信宮燈","width":320,"height":407}}